//! check
//! since: 1.0.0
//! error: LYS-SEM0164
//! stderr-has: '.2' does not apply to an integer
//! stderr-has: '#x' does not apply to a float
//! stderr-has: '+' does not apply to a string
//! stderr-has: '05' does not apply to a char
//! stderr-has: ',' does not apply to a bool
//! stderr-has: '.2' does not apply to a Display type's text
//! stderr-has: '+?' does not apply to a Debug text
//! stderr-has: 'zz' is no format spec
// §12 rule 11 (Lyric 5 12 §2 rule 2): a hole's spec is checked where it is written — one that is
// no spec, or holds a part the value's type does not take, is refused.
println(f"{1:.2}")
println(f"{1.5:#x}")
println(f"{"s":+}")
println(f"{'c':05}")
println(f"{true:,}")
println(f"{[1]:.2}")
println(f"{1:+?}")
println(f"{1:zz}")
